/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (This report draws on direct observation across luxury and premium markets in Europe and Asia, including on-set experience within high-end fashion campaigns in  Italy and Southeast Asia, alongside desk research conducted between 2025 and 2026. The perspective here is deliberately that of an outsider to hotel operations and an insider to the visual language luxury brands )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
