106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (The most coveted hotel experiences of 2026 share one counterintuitive feature: they actively resist being photographed, reviewed, or optimised. The properties gaining traction among ultra-high-net-worth travellers are not the ones with the most amenities, the most visible branding, or the most sophisticated loyalty programmes. They are the ones offering the fewest of all three.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (This is not a niche aesthetic preference: it is a structural market shift; and it is accelerating.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
