109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (What these industry titans are naming, smaller independent operators have been practising for a decade. The difference is that the mainstream has finally arrived at a conclusion boutique hospitality already knew: silence is the new amenity, and restraint is the new signal of quality.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
