<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (This report examines what that means; for the consumer, for the market, and most urgently, for boutique hotel operators navigating a moment when the very attributes that made them niche have become commercially mainstream.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
