/P 82 0 R
/E (The term "slow luxury" risks becoming another empty hospitality buzzword unless it is defined with operational precision. For the purposes of this report, Slow Luxury is not a design aesthetic or a marketing tone. It is a strategic orientation built on three operative dimensions that distinguish it from conventional luxury.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
