265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Le Barn, in the Chevreuse Valley outside Paris, operates without advertising, without OTA presence, and without a conventional marketing strategy. It runs exclusively on direct booking, with a waiting list that functions as both operational reality and brand signal. Visibility is built entirely through earned media and the quiet evangelism of a guest community that treats discretion as a shared cultural code. The underlying logic is precise: if brand equity depends on exclusivity, then accessibility and visibility are not marketing tools: they are brand risks.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
