336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (The line between a private residence and a boutique hotel is dissolving; not because hotels are becoming more residential in feel \(that is already established\) but because residential real estate is becoming operationally hospitality. As of mid-2025, there are approximately 510,810 ultra-high-net-worth individuals globally with a net worth above $30 million, and this number is projected to grow 31% by 2030. Today's ultrawealthy are deliberate in safeguarding their privacy, often moving in circles that eschew exposure. The next product iteration for this demographic is not a better hotel: it is a managed private property that performs like a hotel when desired and disappears from public view when not.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
