/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (A class of properties is developing that does not appear in conventional market data precisely because it is not commercially marketed. Private estates that accept a small number of guests per year by referral only, dinner clubs that operate by personal introduction, retreats that have no website, no booking system, and no public presence: these are not curiosities. They are the leading edge of a demand segment that conventional hospitality infrastructure cannot serve. For boutique operators monitoring competitive landscape, the most significant competition in the next five years may not appear in any STR database.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
